        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Global DL-DXML53SE Grade 1 Entrance Function Mortise Lock </b>\r\n<p>\r\nThe GLO-DL-DXML53SE series is an entrance function Grade 1 heavy duty commercial mortise lockset with solid brass escutcheon trim and ADA compliant lever.  The fire rated latch bolt has a 1\" throw and a 6 pin Schlage \"C\" lock cylinder for security.  It includes a 1 year mechanical and finish warranty. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the GLO DXML Series Mortise Leversets:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Heavy Duty Commercial Grade 1</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Case: 5-13/16\" x 4-5/32\" x 7/8\". </li>\r\n<li>Armored Front: 8\" x 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact us</b> for thicker doors.</a></li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt: 1\" throw</li>\r\n\r\n<li>Door Prep: Fits standard mortise 86 door prep.</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Hand Case: Handed. Reversible in field.</li>\r\n<li>Strike: 4-7/8\" x 1-1/4\"(ASA)</li>\r\n<li>Escutcheon Plate Height: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Escutcheon Plate Width: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Escutcheon Plate Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Chrome</b></li>\r\n<li>Keyways: Schlage \"C\" Standard.</li>\r\n<li>Cylinder: Brass 6-pin mortise cylinder </li>\r\n<li>Certifications: UL R15846 Latch 3 Hour Fire Rated, Grade 1, meets all accessibility requirements of the ADA. </li>\r\n<li>Warranty: 1 Year Mechanical and Finish</li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
