                "title": "Mortise Entry Set, Global DXML53SE",
                "description": "The GLO-DL-DXML53SE series is an entry function grade1 heavy duty commercial mortise lockset with solid brass escutcheon trim and ADA compliant lever.  The fire rated latch bolt has a 1\" throw and a 6 pin Schlage \"C\" lock cylinder for security.  It includes a 1 year mechanical and finish warranty. ",
